# HavenDOS package: boot-lang v0.1.0
NAME BOOT Language
VERSION 0.1.0
DESC TechHaven BOOT programming language

FILE HOME/BOOT_README.TXT
BOOT Language installed.

Quick start:
  boot              - open BOOT REPL
  boot HOME/GREET.BSH  - run a script

Example script (save as HOME/TEST.BSH):
  println "Hello!"
  var x = 10
  println x
ENDFILE

MSG BOOT Language ready. Type: boot
